---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const title = 'Website Terms | Reliance Business Partners';
const description =
  'The terms this website is provided on: the published fees are a fee structure, not a quotation, and nothing here is advice on your situation.';

const toc = [
  { id: 'advice', label: 'This site is not advice' },
  { id: 'prices', label: 'Prices and the estimator' },
  { id: 'engage', label: 'Contacting us does not engage us' },
  { id: 'associates', label: 'Affiliated practices' },
  { id: 'photos', label: 'Photographs' },
  { id: 'accuracy', label: 'Accuracy' },
];
---
<Base title={title} description={description} overHero>
  <PageHero
    variant="plain"
    eyebrow="Terms"
    title="Website <em>terms.</em>"
    lede="What this website is, and what it is not. Short, because a fee structure and a phone number should not need much small print."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Website Terms' }]}
  />

  <Legal toc={toc}>
    <h2 id="advice">This site is not advice</h2>
    <p>
      Everything here is general information about what the firm does. It is not accounting, tax, audit or company-law advice on your situation, and you should not act on it as though it were. Advice comes after we have understood your circumstances.
    </p>
    <h2 id="prices">Prices are a fee structure, not a quotation</h2>
    <p>
      The package prices and the per-director rates on this site are the firm's published fee structure and are stated exactly. They are not an offer, and the instant quotation produces an indicative figure from those rates, not a binding quotation. Starting prices marked &ldquo;from&rdquo; depend on scope. Government charges, and the charges of any third party, are separate unless a package says otherwise.
    </p>
    <h2 id="engage">Contacting us does not engage us</h2>
    <p>
      Calling, e-mailing, messaging on WhatsApp or sending the enquiry form does not by itself create a professional engagement. That begins only when we have agreed in writing to act for you and you have accepted the scope and the fee.
    </p>
    <h2 id="associates">Work carried out by affiliated practices</h2>
    <p>
      {site.legalName} is affiliated with {site.affiliate.name} ({site.affiliate.role}). Tax work is conducted through Synergy Advisors and Sanjeewa Associates, and audit and assurance through Synergy Advisors for corporate clientele and Sanjeewa Associates for sole proprietors and partnerships. Tax and assurance engagements are subject to the appointed provider’s terms, and you are told which practice carries out your matter before the work begins.
    </p>
    <h2 id="photos">Photographs</h2>
    <p>
      The photographs on this site are used under open licences and set the scene only. They do not show the firm's office, staff or clients. Who took each one, and the licence it is used under, is on the <a href="/credits/">image credits</a> page.
    </p>
    <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      We keep this site current, but fees, law and procedure change. If something here matters to a decision you are about to make, ask us to confirm it rather than relying on the page.
    </p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
